Q.1 Write a SQL query to calcualte  total qunantity of orders for each user on a given date. 
SELECT
    user,
    date,
    quantity,
    SUM(quantity) OVER (
        ORDER BY date
        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW
    ) AS cumulative_quantity
FROM original_table;


